Package: vabaxos-reader
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: text
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, vabaxos-voice, poppler-utils, python3-docx, python3-ebooklib
Description: Documents read aloud with a natural voice
 The VabaxOS reader opens text, PDF, Word, EPUB and HTML documents and
 reads them with Kokoro, sentence by sentence, from the cursor. It moves
 by sentence and paragraph, changes speed without losing words (Sonic),
 remembers where each document was left, keeps bookmarks and saves the
 reading as an audio file, for study and for long texts.
